  {
    "description": "Give up paths of the ticket you hold, so other agents can claim work on them. Remove only paths the ticket has; keep[] may name narrower paths inside removed ones (drop a directory, keep the sub-directory you still need). It never adds scope -- use ticket_scope_extend for that -- and refuses to leave the ticket with no paths. Never drop a path your branch has already changed. The server also narrows directories to the files your change touches when you ticket_finish, ticket_discuss or ticket_release; call this earlier to free paths sooner, since where the tenant locks path scopes, a ticket in review holds all its paths until a human acts.",
